(card "exp:C6_anchor_plus_impact_cap" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:C6_anchor_plus_impact_cap"
  :body "---\nnav: 24\ntype: experiment\nid: C6_anchor_plus_impact_cap\nshort_name: anchor_plus_impact_cap\ntitle: \"C6 — anchor + impact cap (Team A top-3 reference)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: a\nround: r2\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: null\ntrain_nav: 2.1977\ntrain_trade_count: 140\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8571\ntrain_sharpe: 7.7307\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0101\nval_nav_mean: 1.0642\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0024\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: 1.2486\ntest_trade_count: 20\ntest_sharpe: 7.15\ntest_win_rate: 0.75\ntest_max_drawdown: -0.0053\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: challenger\noutcome: test_marginal\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [microstructure]\npast_only_window_days: null\nwarmup_required: null\ncreated: 2026-05-17T01:30:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/a, round/r2, axis/microstructure, status/challenger, outcome/test_marginal, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# C6 — anchor + impact cap\n\n> **TL;DR** —— Team A C6: anchor base + impact-aware cap (用 pre_amt impact 调整 cap). train NAV 2.20 marginal +0.01 vs anchor, **test NAV 1.249 与 anchor tie**. 几乎完全 NO-OP - impact cap 在该 trade pool 上没有影响.\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- 假设：用 pre_amt impact 替代 fixed cap 1.3M 让 cap 自适应每 leg.\n- 实测：trade_count 140 (=anchor), NAV 几乎相同. mechanism 基本 NO-OP.\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- `team_a/scripts/round_2_runner.py`\n- 步骤: anchor + impact-aware cap formula.\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- pre_amt past-only. `#leak/clean`.\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.1977 | 140 | 7.73 | 85.7% | -1.01% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0642 ± 0.002 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | 1.2486 | 20 | 7.15 | 75.0% | -0.53% |\n| **Δ test NAV vs anchor** | 0.000 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 0 |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0.\n- bit-for-bit anchor on test = mechanism 在 hold-out 上完全没 active leg.\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **Team A top picks**: [[arc_260516a__team_a__C7__same_minute_pre_amt]], [[arc_260516a__team_a__C20__recent_signal_flow_skip]]\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `team_a/output/cross_round_leaderboard.csv` (C6 row)\n- `cross_team_test_nav_ranking_v2.csv` (C6 test 1.249)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- \"anchor + impact cap\" 是 conservative refinement, train 上几乎 NO-OP. 留作 reference 给未来 cap-tuning 实验对比.\n- 下次类似 axis 应先做 cap-trigger frequency audit, 若机制触发 < 10% legs, 别再 sweep parameter.\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_a__C6__anchor_plus_impact_cap.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:31:48+08:00"
  :ingested_at "2026-05-21T01:29:42+08:00")

